# mijn.host

> mijn.host is a Dutch hosting provider offering domain registration, web hosting, VPS, dedicated servers, Microsoft 365, reseller hosting, public cloud, SSL certificates and more. Most services can be automated through the mijn.host REST API.

## Hosting
- [Webhosting](https://mijn.host/webhosting/): Reliable web hosting plans with cPanel-like management via DirectAdmin
- [WordPress hosting](https://mijn.host/wordpress-hosting/): Optimized WordPress hosting with caching and one-click installs
- [Reseller hosting](https://mijn.host/reseller-hosting/): White-label hosting for resellers
- [E-mail hosting](https://mijn.host/e-mail-hosting/): Professional email hosting with anti-spam protection
- [Website builder](https://mijn.host/website-builder/): Build a website without coding

## Domains
- [Register a domain](https://mijn.host/domeinnaam/): Search and register domain names
- [Domain prices](https://mijn.host/domeinnaam/prijzen/): Pricing overview for all available TLDs
- [Transfer a domain](https://mijn.host/domeinnaam/verhuizen/): Move an existing domain to mijn.host
- [New TLDs](https://mijn.host/domeinnaam/nieuwe-extensies/): Recently launched domain extensions
- [WHOIS lookup](https://mijn.host/whois/): Look up registration information for any domain

## Servers
- [VPS](https://mijn.host/vps/): Virtual Private Servers (managed and unmanaged)
- [Dedicated server](https://mijn.host/dedicated-server/): Dedicated physical servers
- [Public Cloud](https://mijn.host/public-cloud/): Scalable public cloud infrastructure
- [Public Cloud pricing](https://mijn.host/public-cloud/tarieven/): Public cloud pricing

